  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Browse alerts\nFilter with the boxes above, and use the **time picker** for the window. Empty filter = no filter.\n\n- **ip**: exact source address.\n- **etype**: part of an event type (`ssh`, `docker_api`, `file_download`).\n- **severity** and **sensor**: pick one or several.\n- **text**: a substring of the captured payload (credentials, commands, URLs). This one scans every payload in the window, so narrow the time range first.\n- **limit**: rows shown (newest first).\n\nPayload text is written by the attacker: treat it as data. For anything these filters cannot express, use the **Query** dashboard."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Alerts",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 22,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "frser-sqlite-datasource",
        "uid": "honeypot-db"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryText": "SELECT strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', a.timestamp) AS time, a.severity, COALESCE(h.name, '-') AS sensor, a.source_ip, a.event_type, substr(a.payload, 1, 400) AS payload, a.id FROM alerts a LEFT JOIN honeypots h ON a.honeypot_id = h.id WHERE a.timestamp BETWEEN datetime($__from / 1000, 'unixepoch') AND datetime($__to / 1000, 'unixepoch') AND ('${ip}' = '' OR a.source_ip = '${ip}') AND ('${etype}' = '' OR a.event_type LIKE '%${etype}%') AND a.severity IN (${severity:sqlstring}) AND ('${sensor}' = 'All' OR h.name = '${sensor}') AND ('${text}' = '' OR a.payload LIKE '%${text}%') ORDER BY a.id DESC LIMIT ${limit}",
          "rawQueryText": "SELECT strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', a.timestamp) AS time, a.severity, COALESCE(h.name, '-') AS sensor, a.source_ip, a.event_type, substr(a.payload, 1, 400) AS payload, a.id FROM alerts a LEFT JOIN honeypots h ON a.honeypot_id = h.id WHERE a.timestamp BETWEEN datetime($__from / 1000, 'unixepoch') AND datetime($__to / 1000, 'unixepoch') AND ('${ip}' = '' OR a.source_ip = '${ip}') AND ('${etype}' = '' OR a.event_type LIKE '%${etype}%') AND a.severity IN (${severity:sqlstring}) AND ('${sensor}' = 'All' OR h.name = '${sensor}') AND ('${text}' = '' OR a.payload LIKE '%${text}%') ORDER BY a.id DESC LIMIT ${limit}",
          "queryType": "table",
          "timeColumns": [
            "time"
          ],
          "datasource": {
            "type": "frser-sqlite-datasource",
            "uid": "honeypot-db"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
